    <div class="grid-block mb-5 lg:mb-7.5 lg:grid-cols-[minmax(0,1fr)_300px]">
        <div class="space-y-5">
                            <div class="primary-border post-key-points">
                    <ul>
                                                    <li>Ümraniye-Ataşehir-Göztepe Metro Hattı&#039;nda test sürüşü gerçekleştirildi. İBB Başkan Vekili Nuri Aslan, hattın 19 Aralık&#039;ta açılacağını duyurdu.</li>
                                            </ul>
                </div>
                                                                <div class="post-image">
                    <picture>
                        <img src="https://img.cnbce.com/2/740/415/storage/files/images/2026/10/30/istanbulun-yeni-metro-hattinda-sona-dogru-acilis-icin-tarih-verildi-vj8y.jpg" alt="Ümraniye-Ataşehir-Göztepe metrosunda geri sayım: Açılış tarihi açıklandı" width="740" height="415" />
                    </picture>
                </div>
                                                    <div class="content-text">
                <p>Yeni Parti Genel Ba&#351;kan&#305; &Ouml;zg&uuml;r &Ouml;zel, &Uuml;mraniye-Ata&#351;ehir-G&ouml;ztepe Metro Hatt&#305;'n&#305;n test s&uuml;r&uuml;&#351;&uuml;ne kat&#305;ld&#305;.</p>
<a href="https://www.google.com/preferences/source?q=cnbce.com" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer"
   aria-label="CNBCE.COM'u Google haber kayna&#287;&#305;n&#305;z olarak ekleyin"
   class="google-news-follow group not-prose my-6 flex select-none flex-col gap-3 overflow-hidden rounded-xl border-l-[6px] border-secondary bg-gradient-to-r from-primary to-primary-light-2 px-4 py-4 font-sans text-white no-underline shadow-sm transition-shadow hover:shadow-md sm:flex-row sm:items-center sm:gap-4 sm:px-5">
    <span class="flex min-w-0 flex-1 items-center gap-3 sm:gap-4">
        <span class="flex h-11 w-11 shrink-0 items-center justify-center rounded-full bg-white shadow-sm" aria-hidden="true">
            <svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" viewBox="0 0 48 48" width="24" height="24" role="presentation">
                <path fill="#EA4335" d="M24 9.5c3.54 0 6.71 1.22 9.21 3.6l6.85-6.85C35.9 2.38 30.47 0 24 0 14.62 0 6.51 5.38 2.56 13.22l7.98 6.19C12.43 13.72 17.74 9.5 24 9.5z"/>
                <path fill="#4285F4" d="M46.98 24.55c0-1.57-.15-3.09-.38-4.55H24v9.02h12.94c-.58 2.96-2.26 5.48-4.78 7.18l7.73 6C44.98 37.98 48 31.93 48 24c0-.79-.07-1.57-.2-2.33z"/>
                <path fill="#FBBC05" d="M10.53 28.59c-.48-1.45-.76-2.99-.76-4.59s.27-3.14.76-4.59l-7.98-6.19C.92 16.46 0 20.12 0 24c0 3.88.92 7.54 2.56 10.78l7.97-6.19z"/>
                <path fill="#34A853" d="M24 48c6.48 0 11.93-2.13 15.89-5.81l-7.73-6c-2.15 1.45-4.92 2.3-8.16 2.3-6.26 0-11.57-4.22-13.47-9.91l-7.98 6.19C6.51 42.62 14.62 48 24 48z"/>
            </svg>
        </span>
        <span class="min-w-0 flex-1">
            <span class="block text-base font-bold leading-snug sm:text-lg">CNBCE.COM'u &ouml;ncelikli haber kayna&#287;&#305;n&#305;z olarak ekleyin</span>
            <span class="mt-1 hidden text-sm leading-snug text-white/80 sm:block">Ekonomi, i&#351; d&uuml;nyas&#305;, piyasalar ile ilgili en g&uuml;venilir ve en detayl&#305; haberlere en h&#305;zl&#305; &#351;ekilde ula&#351;&#305;n.</span>
        </span>
    </span>
    <span class="inline-flex shrink-0 items-center justify-center gap-1.5 self-start rounded-lg bg-secondary px-4 py-2 text-sm font-bold text-primary transition-colors group-hover:bg-[#e3a400] sm:self-center">
        <span class="text-lg leading-none" aria-hidden="true">+</span>
        Ekle
    </span>
</a>
<div class="adpro paragraph text-center" class="adpro paragraph" data-page=019eeedb-a002-704b-8d95-f00bb53ef9da data-region="019eeedb-9fac-70cb-9eed-7937a6087237" data-category="660d472ab418cf5f790f41e9">
    <!-- Simplicity is the consequence of refined emotions. - Jean D'Alembert -->
</div>
<p>&#304;stanbul B&uuml;y&uuml;k&#351;ehir Belediyesi (&#304;BB) Ba&#351;kan Vekili Nuri Aslan, test s&uuml;r&uuml;&#351;&uuml;n&uuml;n ard&#305;ndan yapt&#305;&#287;&#305; a&ccedil;&#305;klamada hatt&#305;n <strong>19 Aral&#305;k'ta hizmete a&ccedil;&#305;laca&#287;&#305;n&#305;</strong> bildirdi.</p>
<div class="mceNonEditable related-news" data-id="37714"><a title="&#304;stanbul'un toplu ula&#351;&#305;m filosuna 650 yeni ara&ccedil;: Foto&#287;raflar&#305; payla&#351;&#305;ld&#305;" href="https://www.cnbce.com/haberler/istanbulun-toplu-ulasim-filosuna-650-yeni-arac-fotograflari-paylasildi-h37714"><img src="https://img.cnbce.com/2/176/99/storage/files/images/2026/09/21/istanbulun-toplu-ulasim-filosuna-650-yeni-arac-fotograflari-paylasildi-f3hm.jpg" alt="&#304;stanbul'un toplu ula&#351;&#305;m filosuna 650 yeni ara&ccedil;: Foto&#287;raflar&#305; payla&#351;&#305;ld&#305;" srcset="https://img.cnbce.com/2/352/198/storage/files/images/2026/09/21/istanbulun-toplu-ulasim-filosuna-650-yeni-arac-fotograflari-paylasildi-f3hm.jpg 2x" width="176" height="99" loading="lazy"><span class="title">&#304;stanbul'un toplu ula&#351;&#305;m filosuna 650 yeni ara&ccedil;: Foto&#287;raflar&#305; payla&#351;&#305;ld&#305;</span><em>Haberler</em></a></div>
<p>Kad&#305;k&ouml;y'deki 60. Y&#305;l Park&#305; dura&#287;&#305;na gelen &Ouml;zel, &#304;BB Rayl&#305; Sistemler Daire Ba&#351;kan&#305; Ceyhun Av&#351;ar'&#305;n teknik sunumunu dinledi. Ard&#305;ndan metro hatt&#305;n&#305;n test s&uuml;r&uuml;&#351;&uuml; i&ccedil;in araca ge&ccedil;ti.</p>
<p>Test s&uuml;r&uuml;&#351;&uuml; &ouml;ncesinde a&ccedil;&#305;klamalarda bulunan &Ouml;zel, &Uuml;mraniye-Ata&#351;ehir-G&ouml;ztepe Metro Hatt&#305;'n&#305;n farkl&#305; bir anlam ta&#351;&#305;d&#305;&#287;&#305;n&#305; s&ouml;yledi.</p>
<p>&Ouml;zel, b&uuml;y&uuml;k&#351;ehirlerde metro hatlar&#305;n&#305;n genellikle varl&#305;kl&#305; semtler aras&#305;nda in&#351;a edilmeye ba&#351;land&#305;&#287;&#305;n&#305; belirterek, bu hatt&#305;n &Uuml;mraniye'yi denize ba&#287;lad&#305;&#287;&#305;n&#305; ve daha d&uuml;&#351;&uuml;k gelirli b&ouml;lgeleri &#351;ehrin merkezine ula&#351;t&#305;rd&#305;&#287;&#305;n&#305; ifade etti.</p>
<p>&#304;stanbul'da yap&#305;m&#305; yeniden ba&#351;lat&#305;lan 10 metro hatt&#305;ndan ikisinin 2027'de, ikisinin ise 2028'de tamamlanmas&#305;n&#305;n planland&#305;&#287;&#305;n&#305; aktaran &Ouml;zel, projelerde g&ouml;rev alan &#304;BB y&ouml;neticilerine ve &ccedil;al&#305;&#351;anlara te&#351;ekk&uuml;r etti.</p>
<div class="mceNonEditable related-news" data-id="40551"><a title="250 km h&#305;za ula&#351;t&#305;! Milli h&#305;zl&#305; trenin ilk yolculu seferi i&ccedil;in tarih verildi" href="https://www.cnbce.com/haberler/250-km-hiza-ulasti-milli-hizli-trenin-ilk-yolculu-seferi-icin-tarih-verildi-g40551"><img src="https://img.cnbce.com/2/176/99/storage/files/images/2026/10/29/250-km-hiza-ulasti-milli-hizli-trenin-ilk-yolculu-seferi-icin-tarih-verildi-7acu.jpg" alt="250 km h&#305;za ula&#351;t&#305;! Milli h&#305;zl&#305; trenin ilk yolculu seferi i&ccedil;in tarih verildi" srcset="https://img.cnbce.com/2/352/198/storage/files/images/2026/10/29/250-km-hiza-ulasti-milli-hizli-trenin-ilk-yolculu-seferi-icin-tarih-verildi-7acu.jpg 2x" width="176" height="99" loading="lazy"><span class="title">250 km h&#305;za ula&#351;t&#305;! Milli h&#305;zl&#305; trenin ilk yolculu seferi i&ccedil;in tarih verildi</span><em>Haberler</em></a></div>
<h2>&#304;BB'den yeni metro ve otob&uuml;s a&ccedil;&#305;klamas&#305;</h2>
<p>&#304;BB Ba&#351;kan Vekili Nuri Aslan, metro projelerinin yan&#305; s&#305;ra toplu ta&#351;&#305;ma filosunu g&uuml;&ccedil;lendirmeye y&ouml;nelik &ccedil;al&#305;&#351;malar&#305;n da s&uuml;rd&uuml;&#287;&uuml;n&uuml; belirtti.</p>
<p>Aslan, 2 bin otob&uuml;s al&#305;m&#305;na karar verildi&#287;ini, bunlardan 550'si i&ccedil;in ihale yap&#305;ld&#305;&#287;&#305;n&#305; ve 145 otob&uuml;s&uuml;n teslim al&#305;nd&#305;&#287;&#305;n&#305; a&ccedil;&#305;klad&#305;.</p>
<p>Metro ara&ccedil;lar&#305;n&#305;n T&uuml;rkiye'de &uuml;retilmesine y&ouml;nelik &ccedil;al&#305;&#351;malar&#305;n devam etti&#287;ini belirten Aslan, yeni ihalelerin de yap&#305;laca&#287;&#305;n&#305; s&ouml;yledi.</p>
<h2>Test s&uuml;r&uuml;&#351;&uuml; yakla&#351;&#305;k 20 dakika s&uuml;rd&uuml;</h2>
<p>A&ccedil;&#305;klamalar&#305;n ard&#305;ndan &Ouml;zel, Aslan ve beraberindeki heyet metro arac&#305;na binerek test s&uuml;r&uuml;&#351;&uuml;n&uuml; ger&ccedil;ekle&#351;tirdi. &Ouml;zel, hareket merkezine telsizle seslenerek s&uuml;r&uuml;&#351;&uuml; ba&#351;latt&#305;.</p>
<p>Yakla&#351;&#305;k 20 dakika s&uuml;ren test s&uuml;r&uuml;&#351;&uuml;n&uuml;n ard&#305;ndan heyet Ata&#351;ehir &#304;stasyonu'na ula&#351;t&#305;. &#304;stasyonda incelemelerde bulunan kat&#305;l&#305;mc&#305;lar, ziyaretin sonunda hat&#305;ra foto&#287;raf&#305; &ccedil;ektirdi.</p>
            </div>
